    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5e9ff367_b0f0d9b8",
        "filename": "graphics/mapper/4.0/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 104,
      "author": {
        "id": 1029699
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-04T17:55:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does\u0027element\u0027 here refer to \u0027sample\u0027 or \u0027component\u0027? \nAn rgba_8 plane, bit per element can be either 32bits per sample or 8bits per component.",
      "parentUuid": "e69dcf1b_bdf7e34f",
      "revId": "fd57a8232f51b61dc62ec447eb8302d79d7b8980",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4a7bdc3f_9e9e3178",
        "filename": "graphics/mapper/4.0/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 105,
      "author": {
        "id": 1073546
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-08-30T22:33:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We would like a way to tell which plane is which (eg. Y vs CbCR vs R). \n\nWe were thinking of having a bit field which has bits for each potential type of data could be in the buffer.",
      "revId": "fd57a8232f51b61dc62ec447eb8302d79d7b8980",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "932c1af8_6cce98c4",
        "filename": "graphics/mapper/4.0/types.hal",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 105,
