        "id": 1029699
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-04T17:55:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree it is good idea, for now, we use plane index to implicitly infer which plane is which.",
      "parentUuid": "4a7bdc3f_9e9e3178",
      "revId": "fd57a8232f51b61dc62ec447eb8302d79d7b8980",
